And that award went to...
-BTS.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.434
-That's right.
-Yes, it did.

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:28.968
-I mean --
-Deservingly so.

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.000
Come on, now.
-The fans went nuts on Twitter.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.467
They go, "Literally me when BTS
won Artist of the Year."

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.901
-That is an involuntary,
instinctive reaction.

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:38.033
Look at that.
It looks like I won.

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:40.133
-Did you -- I know.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.434
It looks like you won, yeah.
-Yes.

00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:42.767
-Did you fan out?
Are you --

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.601
