gust of wind, just --

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.267
-When they all bow at the same
time, you get a gust of wind.

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:04.934
They form --
They're like Voltron.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:07.133
-Uh-huh.
-They form one giant robot.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.334
Yeah.
-It's everything I want.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.801
Yeah.
I was fed.

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.534
-They're unbelievable.
-They're unbelievable.

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:12.901
They crushed it
at the AMAs, too.

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:14.234
-They're perfectionists.
-Yeah.

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:15.801
-They can sing, they can dance.
-They can do it all.

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:17.167
-They look good,
they know what to do.

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:18.334
-They're, like, popping,
locking, everything, yeah.

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.601
-They're a star.
But I mean -- can --

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:22.133
Can we hear your story?
How did --

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.834
Well, how did you become a star?
-Yes. Oh, my goodness.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:25.133
Okay, so --
-Where did you start?

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:27.634
-It started in Houston, Texas.
Born and raised, H-Town.

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:29.534
[ Cheers ]
Come on H-Town! Represent!

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:31.167
That's right, H-Town,
