00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:33.868
What's up?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:36.067
Then, I had a second birth
on Vine.

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:37.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.434 --> 00:01:38.734
There we go.
Yep, yep, yep.

00:01:38.734 --> 00:01:40.634
-Some people on Vine.
-It's dead now, but, you know...

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:42.367
-Yeah.
Vine -- the Vine died.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.868
-Yeah, Vine died.
Pour one out, every time.

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:45.634
-Yeah.
-But I accidently

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.400
