-Let's talk about

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:00.934
"Liza On Demand." This is...
[ Applause ]

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:02.300
-Yeah.
Thank you.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.567
-...the third season.

