00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:08.067
-It is the final --
third and final season.

00:02:08.067 --> 00:02:09.934
-That's a little bittersweet.
-I'll bring you into the world.

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.167
Here, put 30 seconds
on the clock.

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:12.300
Here's the elevator pitch.
-Mm.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.501
-All right, here we go.
So basically --

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:14.701
[ Drum roll ]
