00:02:16.601 --> 00:02:18.934
Basically, this is the world
of the gig economy, right?

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:21.701
We're all living in a time
of assisted living.

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:23.901
All of us have our own
personal assistants, right?

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.934
You hire somebody to drive you
somewhere to go.

00:02:25.934 --> 00:02:27.734
