if you need it.

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:36.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:38.734
Season three is just, like,
the wrap-up.

00:02:38.734 --> 00:02:41.467
She is embracing herself
as this independent woman

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.601
